# @name login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Jalankan request login terlebih dahulu, lalu kirim request terproteksi.
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==========================================
### TEST ENDPOINT KATEGORI (PRODUCT CATEGORIES)
### ==========================================

### Get All Categories
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Category
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Makanan"
}


### ==========================================
### TEST ENDPOINT PRODUK (PRODUCTS)
### ==========================================

### Get All Products
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ==========================================
### TEST ENDPOINT TRANSAKSI & REPORT
### ==========================================

### Get Transactions
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Dashboard Summary
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}